Ahmed described Maham as &ldquo;my heart, my life, my peace, my home&rdquo; while also asking publications and social media users to respect their privacy and not share unauthorised photographs or videos from their wedding events.
Now, with Maham&rsquo;s latest birthday pictures offering a glimpse into their life together, the couple have once again given fans a look at a celebration filled with laughter, friendship and plenty of personality.

