The trailer for Mango Jutt is out, giving fans a fuller look at Hareem Farooq&rsquo;s return to the big screen alongside Faysal Quraishi in the Punjabi-language action-comedy.
The trailer offers a closer look at the film&rsquo;s Punjabi setting, with Quraishi&rsquo;s character introduced as a rigid, by-the-book cop whose path crosses with Farooq&rsquo;s.
The two share the screen for much of the trailer, with their dynamic forming the emotional core amid the film&rsquo;s stunts and dance sequences.
